  "notes": [
    "Demo parks for the NAMAA seeder (backend/database/seeders/DemoParksSeeder.php). No secrets in this file.",
    "Coordinates are WGS84. lat/lng is the map marker (park centre).",
    "polygon_approximate = true: the seeder builds a rectangle of area_m2 around the centre. To use a real outline, add a GeoJSON Polygon as \"polygon\" (coordinates [lng, lat], closed ring, e.g. drawn at geojson.io) and set polygon_approximate to false.",
    "area_m2 values are estimates. baseline_l_per_day is computed by the seeder as area_m2 x 4 (assumption: 4 L per m2 per day on a fixed schedule).",
    "scenario: real = no seeded readings (history comes from the boards); healthy = normal irrigation history; drying_out = irrigation stopped 2 days ago.",
    "outline_source / area_source: where the outline and the area come from: {type: official | traced | osm | approximate, reference, by (a name), at (date)}. \"company\": \"second\" = the park of the second demo company, created by php artisan namaa:demo:second-company (the seeder skips it). Written by php artisan namaa:parks:export."
